(5041, 777003, 1, 777000, 777003, 1987807621612048384, 777000, 2, 777003, 8864707090662939933, 3, '{\"id\": 1, \"date\": 1762765242, \"media\": {\"webpage\": {\"hash\": 101, \"type\": {\"value\": \"article\"}, \"title\": {\"value\": \"BBC chair to respond to MPs after director general and News CEO resign - BBC News\"}, \"site_name\": {\"value\": \"BBC News\"}, \"url_STRING\": \"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/live/cd9kqz1yyxkt?post=asset%3Ae03f0c6d-48b8-403e-8f9a-34a30eb3eef5#post\\\\u0026quot;\\\\u0026gt;a\", \"description\": {\"value\": \"Samir Shah is expected to apologise for the way Panorama edited a speech by Donald Trump, after Tim Davie and Deborah Turness resign.\"}, \"display_url\": \"www.bbc.co.uk/news/live/cd9kqz1yyxkt?post=asset%3Ae03f0c6d-48b8-403e-8f9a-34a30eb3eef5#post\\\\u0026quot;\\\\u0026gt;a\", \"predicate_name\": \"webPage\"}, \"predicate_name\": \"messageMediaWebPage\"}, \"message\": \"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Davie stood down because of failure\\\",\\\"messageId\\\":\\\"2\\\",\\\"message\\\":\\\"\\\\u0026lt;html\\\\u0026gt;\\\\n\\\\u0026lt;head\\\\u0026gt;\\\\n\\\\t\\\\u0026lt;title\\\\u0026gt;\\\\u0026lt;/title\\\\u0026gt;\\\\n\\\\u0026lt;/head\\\\u0026gt;\\\\n\\\\u0026lt;body\\\\u0026gt;\\\\n\\\\u0026lt;h3\\\\u0026gt;Davie stood down because of failure, not because of \\\\u0026amp;#39;coup\\\\u0026amp;#39; - Dinenagepublished at 15:46\\\\u0026lt;/h3\\\\u0026gt;\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u0026lt;p\\\\u0026gt;15:46\\\\u0026lt;/p\\\\u0026gt;\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u0026lt;p\\\\u0026gt;Asked if there has been\\\\u0026amp;nbsp;\\\\u0026lt;a href=\\\\u0026quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/live/cd9kqz1yyxkt?post=asset%3Ae03f0c6d-48b8-403e-8f9a-34a30eb3eef5#post\\\\u0026quot;\\\\u0026gt;a \\\\u0026amp;quot;coup\\\\u0026amp;quot; by the BBC board\\\\u0026lt;/a\\\\u0026gt;\\\\u0026amp;nbsp;against Tim Davie and Deborah Turness - an argument made by ex-Sun editor David Yelland earlier - Dinenage says the BBC is trying to \\\\u0026amp;quot;obfuscate what the issue is\\\\u0026amp;quot;.\\\